cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this animation, or a screenshot or recording of it, in a talk,
  poster, paper or video, please credit it as below.
type: software
title: "Gravitational-wave lensing animation"
abstract: >-
  Interactive 3D animation of a gravitational wave from a binary black hole
  merger lensed by a galaxy or a galaxy cluster: strong lensing (multiple
  images with magnifications, time delays and Morse phases), weak lensing and
  wave-optics microlensing by a star, with the caustics of the lens and the
  strain recorded by the detector.
authors:
